# game/Scenes/CounselorChats/Conversations/3 - Jamie.rpy:9
translate italian counselorconversation3_535998b2:

    # pc "There's this girl that lives next door to me, Jamie."
    pc "C'è questa ragazza che abita nella porta accanto alla mia, Jamie."

# game/Scenes/CounselorChats/Conversations/3 - Jamie.rpy:10
translate italian counselorconversation3_dcfcdfa2:

    # pc "I can't get her out of my mind."
    pc "Non riesco a togliermela dalla testa."

# game/Scenes/CounselorChats/Conversations/3 - Jamie.rpy:11
translate italian counselorconversation3_bee654f7:

    # sc "You like her?"
    sc "Ti piace?"

# game/Scenes/CounselorChats/Conversations/3 - Jamie.rpy:12
translate italian counselorconversation3_abd0877e:

    # pc "Yeah, but there's more to it than that."
    pc "Sì, ma c'è dell'altro."

# game/Scenes/CounselorChats/Conversations/3 - Jamie.rpy:13
translate italian counselorconversation3_c5ac6fea:

    # pc "We have a history. We dated when we were younger, but then I hurt her."
    pc "Abbiamo un passato insieme. Uscivamo insieme quando eravamo più giovani, ma poi l'ho ferita."

# game/Scenes/CounselorChats/Conversations/3 - Jamie.rpy:14
translate italian counselorconversation3_3b37105b:

    # pc "I didn't mean to, but I did."
    pc "Non volevo, ma l'ho fatto."

# game/Scenes/CounselorChats/Conversations/3 - Jamie.rpy:15
translate italian counselorconversation3_83b99294:

    # pc "Then I left, and now that I'm back it's sort of like we're starting over, but we still have all this history."
    pc "Poi me ne sono andato, e ora che sono tornato è un po’ come se stessimo ricominciando da capo, ma abbiamo comunque tutto quel passato alle spalle."

# game/Scenes/CounselorChats/Conversations/3 - Jamie.rpy:18
translate italian counselorconversation3_af5378b6:

    # pc "Do you know what I mean?"
    pc "Capisci cosa intendo?"

# game/Scenes/CounselorChats/Conversations/3 - Jamie.rpy:19
translate italian counselorconversation3_eec64a34:

    # sc "I think I do. You have memories with her, but it's almost like it's a different person because it's been so long."
    sc "Credo di sì. Hai dei ricordi con lei, ma è quasi come se fosse una persona diversa perché è passato così tanto tempo."

# game/Scenes/CounselorChats/Conversations/3 - Jamie.rpy:20
translate italian counselorconversation3_de5061cc:

    # pc "Exactly! I remember hanging out with her when we were younger, but both of us have changed so much it's sort of like remembering a movie."
    pc "Esatto! Ricordo quando uscivamo insieme da giovani, ma siamo cambiati entrambi così tanto che è un po’ come ricordare un film."

# game/Scenes/CounselorChats/Conversations/3 - Jamie.rpy:21
translate italian counselorconversation3_a7dabb45:

    # sc "Does it bother you?"
    sc "Ti dà fastidio?"

# game/Scenes/CounselorChats/Conversations/3 - Jamie.rpy:22
translate italian counselorconversation3_72e3f009:

    # pc "No, not at all."
    pc "No, per niente."

# game/Scenes/CounselorChats/Conversations/3 - Jamie.rpy:23
translate italian counselorconversation3_65acc085:

    # pc "It's nice actually. It's like we have a head start."
    pc "Anzi, è bello. È come se partissimo in vantaggio."

# game/Scenes/CounselorChats/Conversations/3 - Jamie.rpy:24
translate italian counselorconversation3_46d1797b:

    # pc "What happened before isn't holding our relationship back at all. It's really like we just skipped the first couple of levels, you know? Because we already did them."
    pc "Quello che è successo prima non sta ostacolando affatto la nostra relazione. È davvero come se avessimo saltato i primi due livelli, capisci? Perché li abbiamo già superati."

# game/Scenes/CounselorChats/Conversations/3 - Jamie.rpy:25
translate italian counselorconversation3_abd28437:

    # sc "So things are getting serious with her?"
    sc "Quindi le cose stanno diventando serie con lei?"

# game/Scenes/CounselorChats/Conversations/3 - Jamie.rpy:26
translate italian counselorconversation3_ee1883b8:

    # pc "I don't know if I'd call it serious, but we both like each other."
    pc "Non so se lo definirei una cosa seria, ma ci piacciamo a vicenda."

# game/Scenes/CounselorChats/Conversations/3 - Jamie.rpy:27
translate italian counselorconversation3_d72f2f51:

    # sc "Companionship is good. You should have somebody in your life that you can rely on."
    sc "La compagnia è una bella cosa. Dovresti avere qualcuno nella tua vita su cui poter contare."

# game/Scenes/CounselorChats/Conversations/3 - Jamie.rpy:28
translate italian counselorconversation3_7d69eb5d:

    # sc "Somebody who makes you happy."
    sc "Qualcuno che ti renda felice."

# game/Scenes/CounselorChats/Conversations/3 - Jamie.rpy:30
translate italian counselorconversation3_1487ed22:

    # "Her voice suddenly takes on a somber tone as she says this, as if she does not have that someone."
    "La sua voce assume improvvisamente un tono malinconico mentre lo dice, come se lei non avesse quella persona."

# game/Scenes/CounselorChats/Conversations/3 - Jamie.rpy:31
translate italian counselorconversation3_5d687698:

    # "But you've seen the ring on her finger, you know that she's married."
    "Ma hai visto l’anello al suo dito, sai che è sposata."

# game/Scenes/CounselorChats/Conversations/3 - Jamie.rpy:35
translate italian counselorconversation3_3c7fbaef:

    # sc "Oh, yes I'm fine."
    sc "Oh, sì, sto bene."

# game/Scenes/CounselorChats/Conversations/3 - Jamie.rpy:39
translate italian counselorconversation3_fa2bc12a:

    # sc "Good, I'm happy for you."
    sc "Bene, sono felice per te."

# game/Scenes/CounselorChats/Conversations/3 - Jamie.rpy:41
translate italian counselorconversation3_fc38e4d4:

    # sc "Well it's about time for you to get to class."
    sc "Beh, è ora che tu vada a lezione."

# game/Scenes/CounselorChats/Conversations/3 - Jamie.rpy:42
translate italian counselorconversation3_a8c43555:

    # pc "Okay, I'll see you next time Gertrude."
    pc "Ok, ci vediamo la prossima volta, Gertrude."

# game/Scenes/CounselorChats/Conversations/3 - Jamie.rpy:43
translate italian counselorconversation3_1b784c07:

    # sc "Bye, [pcname]."
    sc "Ciao, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/CounselorChats/Conversations/3 - Jamie.rpy:44
translate italian counselorconversation3_e4b88e88:

    # "With that, I stand up and head to class."
    "Detto questo, mi alzo e mi dirigo verso l’aula."

